<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS (1715 GMT).</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS (1715 GMT).</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results on the 11th</p>
<p>day of the French Open tennis tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>* denotes new results</p>
<p>Semi-finals:</p>
<p>*9-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-3 4-6 7-5</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 3-Monica Seles (U.S.) 6-7</p>
<p>(2-7) 7-5 6-4</p>
</text>
